### Phase 6 剩餘驗收：後台文章／應用方案／FAQ／下載／據點
### 前提：func start 執行中，seed 已跑（7 應用方案、6 文章、6 文章分類、3 FAQ、3 下載、5 據點）。
###
### ⚠️ 這份會建立、修改、刪除資料。跑完務必執行最後一節的清理與核對，
###    七個數字要回到上面那組，否則測試資料留在庫裡。

@host = http://localhost:7071/api

### 0. 登入取 token
# @name login
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@eunicemed.local", "password": "REPLACE_WITH_LOCAL_SEED_PASSWORD" }

@at = {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 種子固定 ID
@knee = 61111111-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

###############################################################################
# 1. 文章分類
#
# slug **只在同一個 Kind 內唯一**（`UX_ArticleCategory (Kind, Slug)`）——
# seed 的 `sponsorship` 在 news 與 insight 各有一筆，那是刻意的。
###############################################################################

### 1a. 全部（含 articleCount）
GET {{host}}/admin/article-categories
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}

### 1b. 只看 insight
GET {{host}}/admin/article-categories?kind=insight
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}

### 1c. news 已有 exhibitions，在 insight 下建同 slug → 應 **201**（不同 kind 不算撞號）
# @name dupSlug
POST {{host}}/admin/article-categories
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "kind": 2, "slug": "exhibitions", "translations": { "en": { "name": "Exhibitions (insight)" } } }

### 1d. 同 kind 同 slug → 應 409
POST {{host}}/admin/article-categories
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "kind": 2, "slug": "exhibitions", "translations": { "en": { "name": "Dup" } } }

### 1e. 刪掉 1c 建的（沒有文章引用）→ 應 200
DELETE {{host}}/admin/article-categories/{{dupSlug.response.body.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}

### 1f. 刪有文章的分類 → 應 409（訊息帶文章數）
DELETE {{host}}/admin/article-categories/REPLACE_WITH_A_CATEGORY_THAT_HAS_ARTICLES
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}

### 1g. 有文章時換 kind → 應 409
#   Kind 必須等於文章的 Type，換掉會讓底下文章與分類不符
PUT {{host}}/admin/article-categories/REPLACE_WITH_A_CATEGORY_THAT_HAS_ARTICLES
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "kind": 2 }

###############################################################################
# 2. 文章：分類 kind 必須等於文章 type
#
# 這條 FK 表達不了（需要複合 FK），所以由應用層驗證。不擋的話 insight 可以掛到
# news 分類下，公開列表兩邊都照 Type 撈，那篇會在側欄計數裡出現、點進分類卻找不到。
###############################################################################

### 2a. kind / type 不符 → 應 400
POST {{host}}/admin/articles
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "slug": "qa-a", "type": 1, "categoryId": "REPLACE_WITH_AN_INSIGHT_CATEGORY_ID",
  "translations": { "en": { "title": "x" } } }

### 2b. 建立 news 文章 → 應 201，status = 0（草稿）
# @name created
POST {{host}}/admin/articles
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slug": "qa-test-news",
  "type": 1,
  "categoryId": "REPLACE_WITH_A_NEWS_CATEGORY_ID",
  "readMinutes": 4,
  "translations": {
    "en": {
      "title": "QA Test News",
      "standfirst": "lead",
      "body": "<h2>First</h2><p>a</p><script>alert(1)</script><h2>Second</h2><p>b</p>"
    },
    "zh-TW": { "title": "QA 測試新聞" }
  }
}

@aid = {{created.response.body.data.id}}

### 2c. 草稿的公開詳情 → 應 404
GET {{host}}/news/qa-test-news?locale=en

### 2d. 發布
POST {{host}}/admin/articles/{{aid}}/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}

### 2e. 公開詳情。必須確認：
#   toc  = [{id:"first",text:"First"},{id:"second",text:"Second"}]
#   body = <h2 id="first">First</h2><p>a</p><h2 id="second">Second</h2><p>b</p>
#          —— script 整段消失，且 **anchor id 已回填進 body**
#          （只回 toc 不改 HTML 的話前端會跳到不存在的錨點）
GET {{host}}/news/qa-test-news?locale=en

### 2f. 已發布的文章改 type → 應 409
#   網址會從 /news/{slug} 變成 /insights/{slug}，舊網址立刻失效。
#   注意要一併 clearCategory，否則會先被「分類 kind 不符」的 400 攔下來。
PUT {{host}}/admin/articles/{{aid}}
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": 2, "clearCategory": true }

###############################################################################
# 3. 排程發布
#
# `PublishedAt` 為未來時間者，狀態是 Published 但公開端點一律查不到
# （docs/13 Phase 6）。因此 /publish 用 ??= 而非直接指派 ——
# 覆寫成 now 等於把編輯者排好的時間默默取消掉。
###############################################################################

### 3a. 設一個未來時間
PUT {{host}}/admin/articles/{{aid}}
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "publishedAt": "2027-01-01T00:00:00Z" }

### 3b. 發布 → 訊息應說明「已排程於 … 發布，在那之前前台查不到」
POST {{host}}/admin/articles/{{aid}}/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}

### 3c. 後台看得到（status = 1、publishedAt = 2027）
GET {{host}}/admin/articles/{{aid}}
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}

### 3d. 公開詳情 → 應 404（排程時間未到）
GET {{host}}/news/qa-test-news?locale=en

### 3e. 公開列表 → 不應含 qa-test-news
GET {{host}}/news?locale=en&pageSize=50

### 3f. 改回過去時間 → 公開詳情應 200
PUT {{host}}/admin/articles/{{aid}}
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "publishedAt": "2026-08-01T00:00:00Z" }

###
GET {{host}}/news/qa-test-news?locale=en

### 3g. 取消發布後再發布 → publishedAt 應維持不變（首次發布時間不可竄改）
POST {{host}}/admin/articles/{{aid}}/unpublish
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}

###
POST {{host}}/admin/articles/{{aid}}/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}

###############################################################################
# 4. 活動面板（NewsEvent，與 Article 共用主鍵的 1:1）
###############################################################################

### 4a. 建立 / 更新（PUT 同時負責兩者）
PUT {{host}}/admin/articles/{{aid}}/event
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startDate": "2026-09-01", "endDate": "2026-09-04",
  "contactEmail": "a@b.c", "ctaUrl": "https://x.test",
  "translations": {
    "en":    { "datesLabel": "1–4 Sep 2026", "venue": "Taipei Nangang", "booth": "K1234", "ctaLabel": "Book a meeting" },
    "zh-TW": { "venue": "台北南港" }
  }
}

### 4b. endDate 早於 startDate → 應 400
PUT {{host}}/admin/articles/{{aid}}/event
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "startDate": "2026-09-04", "endDate": "2026-09-01" }

### 4c. 掛到 insight 上 → 應 400（活動面板是 News 專屬版位，掛上去前台永遠不渲染）
PUT {{host}}/admin/articles/REPLACE_WITH_AN_INSIGHT_ARTICLE_ID/event
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "startDate": "2026-09-01" }

### 4d. GET event
GET {{host}}/admin/articles/{{aid}}/event
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}

### 4e. 公開詳情應帶 event 面板
GET {{host}}/news/qa-test-news?locale=en

###############################################################################
# 5. 圖庫（ArticleImage）—— 整批取代，陣列順序即畫面順序
###############################################################################

### 5a. 送兩張，sortOrder 故意給 5 與 1
PUT {{host}}/admin/articles/{{aid}}/gallery
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "images": [ { "mediaId": "REPLACE_MEDIA_B", "sortOrder": 5 },
              { "mediaId": "REPLACE_MEDIA_A", "sortOrder": 1 } ] }

### 5b. GET gallery → sortOrder 應重編為 0、1，且順序是 A 在前（照送出的 sortOrder 排）
GET {{host}}/admin/articles/{{aid}}/gallery
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}

### 5c. 引用反查應出現 Article / gallery/0
GET {{host}}/admin/media/REPLACE_MEDIA_A/usages
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}

###############################################################################
# 6. 應用方案
#
# 這個模組獨有的是**人體圖座標**：`{hotspot:{cx,cy},chip:{cx,cy}}`。
# 少一個值，前端畫熱區時拿到 NaN，整張人體圖靜默不顯示 —— 所以在寫入時就驗形狀。
###############################################################################

### 6a. type=1（依部位）卻沒 bodyPartId → 應 400
#   公開端點的產品數是「手動關聯 ∪ 同 BodyPart 的產品」，沒綁部位就永遠是 0
POST {{host}}/admin/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "slug": "qa-app", "type": 1, "translations": { "en": { "name": "x" } } }

### 6b. mapPosition 少了 cy → 應 400
POST {{host}}/admin/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "slug": "qa-app", "type": 1, "bodyPartId": "{{knee}}",
  "mapPosition": { "hotspot": { "cx": 10 }, "chip": { "cx": 1, "cy": 2 } },
  "translations": { "en": { "name": "x" } } }

### 6c. 建立（showOnBodyMap = true 但先不給座標）→ 應 201，status = 0
# @name app
POST {{host}}/admin/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slug": "qa-test-app", "type": 1, "bodyPartId": "{{knee}}", "showOnBodyMap": true,
  "productIds": ["REPLACE_WITH_A_PRODUCT_ID"],
  "translations": {
    "en":    { "name": "QA Test Application", "lead": "lead",
               "body": "<p>ok</p><script>x()</script>",
               "stats": [{ "value": "auto", "label": "Products" }] },
    "zh-TW": { "name": "QA 測試方案" }
  }
}

@appid = {{app.response.body.data.id}}

### 6d. 發布 → 應 400（要上人體圖卻沒座標，發布了也不會出現）
POST {{host}}/admin/applications/{{appid}}/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}

### 6e. 補正確座標
PUT {{host}}/admin/applications/{{appid}}
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mapPosition": { "hotspot": { "cx": 120, "cy": 240 }, "chip": { "cx": 180, "cy": 230 } } }

### 6f. 再發布 → 應 200
POST {{host}}/admin/applications/{{appid}}/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}

### 6g. 公開詳情。必須確認：
#   body 的 script 已淨化
#   stats 的 "auto" 已代入實際產品數（膝 = 16）
#   recommendedProducts 含 6c 手動掛的那筆
GET {{host}}/applications/qa-test-app?locale=en

### 6h. 人體圖應含 qa-test-app
GET {{host}}/applications/body-map?locale=en

###############################################################################
# 7. FAQ
###############################################################################

### 7a. answer 淨化後為空 → 應 400
#   讓它落地會變成前台一個點得開但空白的問答
POST {{host}}/admin/faqs
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "faqCategoryId": "REPLACE_WITH_FAQ_CATEGORY_ID",
  "translations": { "en": { "question": "Q", "answer": "<script>alert(1)</script>" } } }

### 7b. 建立 → 應 201
# @name faq
POST {{host}}/admin/faqs
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "faqCategoryId": "REPLACE_WITH_FAQ_CATEGORY_ID", "sortOrder": 99,
  "translations": {
    "en":    { "question": "QA test question?",
               "answer": "<p>Answer</p><script>x()</script><a href=\"javascript:x()\">bad</a>" },
    "zh-TW": { "question": "QA 測試題", "answer": "<p>答案</p>" }
  }
}

### 7c. 淨化結果應為 `<p>Answer</p><a>bad</a>`（script 整段消失、javascript: 的 href 被剝掉）
GET {{host}}/admin/faqs/{{faq.response.body.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}

### 7d. 公開 FAQ 應含它
GET {{host}}/faqs?locale=en

### 7e. 刪有題目的 FAQ 分類 → 應 409
DELETE {{host}}/admin/faq-categories/REPLACE_WITH_FAQ_CATEGORY_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}

### 7f. FAQ 分類 slug 撞號 → 應 409
POST {{host}}/admin/faq-categories
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "slug": "use", "translations": { "en": { "name": "Dup" } } }

### 7g. 刪 FAQ
DELETE {{host}}/admin/faqs/{{faq.response.body.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}

###############################################################################
# 8. 下載
#
# `fileLocale` 是**檔案本身的語言**，與翻譯的 locale（介面語系）是兩件事，
# 所以**刻意不套站台語系白名單** —— 可能有站台沒有的語言（如日文型錄）。
###############################################################################

### 8a. 建立（fileLocale 給 JA，掛一筆產品）→ 應 201
# @name dl
POST {{host}}/admin/downloads
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mediaId": "REPLACE_MEDIA_A", "type": 1, "fileLocale": "JA", "sortOrder": 99,
  "productIds": ["REPLACE_WITH_A_PRODUCT_ID"],
  "translations": { "en": { "title": "QA Catalogue", "description": "temp" },
                    "zh-TW": { "title": "QA 型錄" } }
}

### 8b. 讀回：fileLocale 應原樣是 "JA"，productIds 一筆，fileUrl 已解析
GET {{host}}/admin/downloads/{{dl.response.body.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}

### 8c. 仍掛在產品上時刪除 → 應 409
DELETE {{host}}/admin/downloads/{{dl.response.body.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}

### 8d. 取消掛載
PUT {{host}}/admin/downloads/{{dl.response.body.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productIds": [] }

### 8e. 再刪 → 應 200
DELETE {{host}}/admin/downloads/{{dl.response.body.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}

### 8f. 未知 type → 應 400
GET {{host}}/admin/downloads?type=bogus
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}

###############################################################################
# 9. 銷售據點
###############################################################################

### 9a. 建立（countryCode 給小寫 jp）→ 應 201
# @name loc
POST {{host}}/admin/sales-locations
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "locationType": 2, "countryCode": "jp", "websiteUrl": "https://x.test", "sortOrder": 99,
  "translations": { "en": { "name": "QA Distributor", "regionLabel": "Asia Pacific", "address": "Tokyo" },
                    "zh-TW": { "name": "QA 經銷商" } }
}

### 9b. 讀回：countryCode 應為大寫 "JP"
GET {{host}}/admin/sales-locations/{{loc.response.body.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}

### 9c. clearWebsiteUrl → websiteUrl 應變 null
#   （null 已被用來表示「這次不動它」，所以清空要靠明確旗標）
PUT {{host}}/admin/sales-locations/{{loc.response.body.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "clearWebsiteUrl": true }

### 9d. 公開據點（伺服器端分組 domestic / international）
GET {{host}}/sales-locations?locale=en

### 9e. 刪除
DELETE {{host}}/admin/sales-locations/{{loc.response.body.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}

###############################################################################
# 10. RBAC：有草稿工作流的模組 Author+，沒有的 Editor+
#
# FAQ / 下載 / 據點 / 文章分類沒有發布端點，`status` 是 payload 裡的欄位、存檔即生效。
# 開放 Author 寫入的話，他只要在建立時送 status=1 就直接上線，
# 等於繞過「Author 不可發布」。所以那四個模組的寫入是 Editor+。
###############################################################################

### 10a. 建 Author 帳號
POST {{host}}/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "qa-author2@eunicemed.local", "password": "QaAuthor#2026", "displayName": "QA Author", "roles": ["Author"] }

### 10b. Author 登入
# @name authorLogin
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "qa-author2@eunicemed.local", "password": "QaAuthor#2026" }

@aat = {{authorLogin.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 10c. Author 改文章草稿 → 應 200
PUT {{host}}/admin/articles/{{aid}}
Authorization: Bearer {{aat}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "readMinutes": 6 }

### 10d. Author 發布文章 → 應 403
POST {{host}}/admin/articles/{{aid}}/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{aat}}

### 10e. Author 建應用方案 → 應 201（一律建為草稿）
POST {{host}}/admin/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{aat}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "slug": "qa-author-app", "type": 2, "translations": { "en": { "name": "x" } } }

### 10f. Author 發布應用方案 → 應 403
POST {{host}}/admin/applications/{{appid}}/unpublish
Authorization: Bearer {{aat}}

### 10g. Author **寫** FAQ → 應 403
POST {{host}}/admin/faqs
Authorization: Bearer {{aat}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "faqCategoryId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000" }

### 10h. Author **讀** FAQ → 應 200
GET {{host}}/admin/faqs
Authorization: Bearer {{aat}}

###############################################################################
# 11. 清理與核對
#
# 跑完這節，下面七個數字必須是：
#   applications 7、articles 6、article-categories 6、faqs 3、
#   faq-categories 3、downloads 3、sales-locations 5
###############################################################################

### 11a. 刪測試文章
DELETE {{host}}/admin/articles/{{aid}}
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}

### 11b. 刪測試應用方案
DELETE {{host}}/admin/applications/{{appid}}
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}

### 11c. 刪 10e 建的那筆
GET {{host}}/admin/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}

### 11d. 刪 Author 帳號
GET {{host}}/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}

### 11e. 核對
GET {{host}}/admin/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}

###
GET {{host}}/admin/articles
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}

###
GET {{host}}/admin/article-categories
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}

###
GET {{host}}/admin/faqs
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}

###
GET {{host}}/admin/faq-categories
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}

###
GET {{host}}/admin/downloads
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}

###
GET {{host}}/admin/sales-locations
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}
